stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: Admin generates bill<br/>(reading + tariff applied)

    DRAFT --> PENDING: Submit for approval
    PENDING --> APPROVED: ADMIN / FINANCE approves
    PENDING --> DRAFT: Reject / revise

    APPROVED --> PARTIAL: Partial payment recorded
    PARTIAL --> PARTIAL: More partial payments
    PARTIAL --> PAID: balance = 0<br/>(DB trigger + notification)

    APPROVED --> PAID: Full payment recorded<br/>(DB trigger + notification)
    APPROVED --> OVERDUE: Past due_date<br/>with balance > 0

    OVERDUE --> PARTIAL: Partial payment
    OVERDUE --> PAID: Full payment

    PAID --> [*]

    note right of DRAFT
        Customer must be ACTIVE
        Meter must be ACTIVE
        One bill per meter/month/year
    end note

    note right of APPROVED
        DB Trigger on INSERT (bill):
        "Dear CustomerName,
        Your Month/Year utility bill
        of Amount FRW has been processed."
    end note

    note right of PAID
        DB Trigger on full payment:
        Update status = PAID
        Insert payment confirmation notification
    end note
